			<string>Smart: minis are live while you use the bench, turn into still pictures after the pause set below, and wake when you touch the bench again. Their apps are suspended while they are stills, so they cost no battery.

Always Live: every app on the bench keeps running. Uses the most battery.

Stills Only: only the big app runs; a mini is refreshed when it comes off the big tile.</string>
